; Callers that parse an expression out of a longer stream (a posting's
; parenthesized amount or cost, a format's %(...)) still stop where the
; expression ends: text after it is not a parse error there.

2024/01/05 Grocer
    Expenses:Food                 ($5.00 * 3)  ; tripled
    Assets:Cash

2024/01/06 Broker
    Assets:Shares                 2 ABC @ ($5.00 * 2)  ; doubled
    Assets:Cash

test reg --format '%(payee) %(amount)\n'
Grocer $15.00
Grocer $-15.00
Broker 2 ABC {$10.00} [2024/01/06]
Broker $-20.00
end test
